message: "Si usas BIOCOGNIA (QUAESTIA, SORTIVIA o DEAba Digital), cita el software así. Las preguntas de QUAESTIA se citan a través de la Guía de Bioquímica Metabólica (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22299277). / If you use BIOCOGNIA, please cite the software as below; QUAESTIA questions are cited through the Metabolic Biochemistry Guide (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22299277)."
